			y: 0.0d
			shape: "star"
			size: 1.5d
			dependencies: ["70AE548090DE3D9A"]
			description: [
				"&d&o\"Part of the Dream has drowned. Only an ocean is left: islands, reefs and wrecks, and the people who once lived there are gone.\""
				""
				"&7This chapter is &eBeach Craft&7: a whole ocean dimension with islands, coral reefs and deep trenches, its own creatures, a story and a boss at the bottom of the sea."
				"&7To get there you need a portal of &edriftwood&7, lit with an &eEnergy Staff&7. Its parts come from the oceans of the overworld."
			]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "58B48DEF8B4CEB54", type: "item", item: "minecraft:fishing_rod" }
			]
