			description: [
				"&d&o\"Breathe in. Smell the salt? Welcome to the Endless Sea.\""
				""
				"&7Right-click the frame with the Energy Staff and step through. You land on a driftwood platform high above the waves, with a portal back home."
				"&7On a new platform a castaway's chest is waiting for you. Open it!"
				"&7Later, the &eRaft Dimension Teleporter&7 (5 titanium ingots and 2 Ancient Energy) takes you to the sea and back home without a portal, 64 times."
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "E2F62155607C9745"
