			description: [
				"&d&o\"Someone was here before you. They left you a chest.\""
				""
				"&7Open the chest on your arrival platform: a note, a chart, food, a paddle, a hook and the &eExpedition Journal&7."
				"&7Use the journal to read your current goal and a hint. It follows your progress by itself."
				"&7Your platform is older than Beach Craft 3? Then craft the journal: a book, a compass and paper."
				""
				"&7The story chapters of the sea follow below, one quest each. Reward: an almanac that opens at its spoiler-free story chapter."
			]
